  "description": "JVM / Tomcat / HikariCP process-level metrics for the hapi-fhir application itself, scraped directly from HAPI's own /actuator/prometheus endpoint (job=\"hapi-fhir\") rather than from GKE. Despite the dashboard's name, no cluster filter is applied on any tile, so every line mixes aa-stg and aa-prod pods together — check each series' resource labels to tell environments apart. Covers HikariCP connection-pool usage and Tomcat session count, which the unified \"Arogyam Platform\" dashboard's HAPI FHIR section doesn't.",
